description 2 has the description "Commercial agreements between B2B MDMS providers and business suers shall not intentionally or otherwise: (a) prevent a business user from subscribing to or using any other similar system, (b) require the acceptance of additional conditions to be accepted which are not necessary for the subscription to the B2B MDMS, (c) impose an obligation to accept specific technical equipment or software, and (d) impose any other unfair or unjustified conditions.".


