interop 1 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/interop/1".

interop 1 is a public service.

interop 1 has the label "Designation of B2C MDMS providers with significant market presence".

interop 1 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2026/231/cod/doc/com/COM_2026_231/FINAL/eng/art_4".

interop 1 has the description "An MDMS provider shall be designated as B2C MDMS provider with significant market power for the distribution of transport products for that transport mode (‘significant market presence’) at Union level if it meets the thresholds laid down in point 1 of Annex I. It shall notify the Commission thereof and provide information on the number of tickets sold per mode and their value.".

interop 1 has for "dcterms:identifier" the value "interop/1".

interop 1 has the title "Designation of B2C MDMS providers with significant market presence".


